      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dawson_Creek",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Peace River region was once home to nomadic Sekanni and Beaver peoples, later inhabited by Cree before European exploration in the late 1700s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
